{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GchbaRaxLUke19J1cafB6v","type":"tool_result","content":"1054:- `game.audio.define(name, voice)`: add or replace a named sound: audio.define('zap', { wave: 'saw', freq: 1200, to: 200, dur: .2 })\n1063:- `game.audio.sfx(what, o = {})`: Play a sound effect: a preset name ('jump', 'coin', 'hit', 'explode', ...), a voice object, or a list of voices. opts: { vol: 0..1, pitch: multiplier, vary: random pitch spread (default 0.03), step: a step of the music pl\n1075:- `game.audio.presets`: the named sound effects, sfx(name) plays one and define(name, voice) adds one\n1106:- `new E.Dialog(game, o = {}) → talk`: new E.Dialog(game, { speed, lines, place, color, nameColor, voice, bg, border, vars }): a dialog box that types its text; say() opens it, update(dt) and draw(r) run it\n1134:- `talk.voice = 'text'`: the sound effect each letter blips ('text'; null for silence)\n1543:- `new E.Rhythm(game, o = {}) → rhythm` †: new E.Rhythm(game, { song, chart, lanes, windows, life, lead, voice, on }): see the manual\n1570:- `rhythm.voice` †: the calls' sound\n----\n19:10984-  /** one step: steering, engine, grip, drift, the surface, then E.Body's walls and hop. c: an input or an intent */\n21:10986-    const o = this.o, inp = typeof c.move === 'function';\n22:10987-    let steer = inp ? c.move()[0] : c.steer || 0, gas = inp ? (c.down('gas') || o.auto ? 1 : 0) : c.gas || 0, brake = inp ? (c.down('brake') ? 1 : 0) : c.brake || 0;\n23:10988-    const drift = inp ? c.down('drift') : !!c.drift, hop = inp ? c.pressed('drift') : drift && !this._held;\n----\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181316__x96eb17/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b632459b-63ed-4a16-8c86-b1a0aae1dd98","uuid":"413f4934-9e8b-40a7-966a-c6c346fee55f","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:17:53.664Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"1054:- `game.audio.define(name, voice)`: add or replace a named sound: audio.define('zap', { wave: 'saw', freq: 1200, to: 200, dur: .2 })\n1063:- `game.audio.sfx(what, o = {})`: Play a sound effect: a preset name ('jump', 'coin', 'hit', 'explode', ...), a voice object, or a list of voices. opts: { vol: 0..1, pitch: multiplier, vary: random pitch spread (default 0.03), step: a step of the music pl\n1075:- `game.audio.presets`: the named sound effects, sfx(name) plays one and define(name, voice) adds one\n1106:- `new E.Dialog(game, o = {}) → talk`: new E.Dialog(game, { speed, lines, place, color, nameColor, voice, bg, border, vars }): a dialog box that types its text; say() opens it, update(dt) and draw(r) run it\n1134:- `talk.voice = 'text'`: the sound effect each letter blips ('text'; null for silence)\n1543:- `new E.Rhythm(game, o = {}) → rhythm` †: new E.Rhythm(game, { song, chart, lanes, windows, life, lead, voice, on }): see the manual\n1570:- `rhythm.voice` †: the calls' sound\n----\n19:10984-  /** one step: steering, engine, grip, drift, the surface, then E.Body's walls and hop. c: an input or an intent */\n21:10986-    const o = this.o, inp = typeof c.move === 'function';\n22:10987-    let steer = inp ? c.move()[0] : c.steer || 0, gas = inp ? (c.down('gas') || o.auto ? 1 : 0) : c.gas || 0, brake = inp ? (c.down('brake') ? 1 : 0) : c.brake || 0;\n23:10988-    const drift = inp ? c.down('drift') : !!c.drift, hop = inp ? c.pressed('drift') : drift && !this._held;\n----","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181316__x96eb17/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01GchbaRaxLUke19J1cafB6v","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
