' },   one token per step\n7631-   *   { wave: 'triangle', notes: 'C3 . C3 . G2 . G2 .' },\n7632-   *   { wave: 'drums', notes: 'k . h . s . h . k k h . s . h .' } ] }\n7633-   * tokens: C4 F#3 Bb2 = note, '-' holds the previous note, '.' = rest, '|' is ignored (bar lines).\n7634-   * steps = steps per beat (4 = sixteenth notes). Each track loops on its own length within the song's (len: steps, else\n7635-   * its longest track's); a track may have a name, and on: false starts it silent (a layer that audio.layer brings in).\n7636-   * THE MUSIC CLOCK: a song starts at the game's time and where it is is game time (audio.pos, headless too: the same\n7637-   * steps hear the same beats); the sound follows that clock. o: { loop, sync: true (it pauses with the game, on\n7638-   * game.time; else it plays on through a pause, on game.real), fade: seconds (a crossfade from the song playing),\n7639-   * restart: true (again from its start, though it is the one playing) }.\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181316__x96eb17/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b632459b-63ed-4a16-8c86-b1a0aae1dd98","uuid":"a8e5a950-cc2a-4442-bae5-15470ca4b452","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:21:50.906Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"3316:    this._g = game; this._dur = Math.max(0, +seconds || 0); this._t = -(+o.delay || 0); this._from = null; this._k = 0; this._yoyo = !!o.yoyo; this._onDone = o.onDone || null;\n7588:    const t = t0 + (p.delay || 0), end = t + dur, f0 = Math.max(20, noteFreq(p.freq || 440) * mul), to = p.to ? Math.max(20, noteFreq(p.to) * mul) : 0;\n7614:  sfx(what, o = {}) {\n7615-    if (!this._init() || this.muted) return;\n7616-    const p = typeof what === 'string' ? this.presets[what] : what;\n7617-    if (!p) { warn('sfx:' + what, 'unknown sound \"' + what + '\". Presets: ' + Object.keys(this.presets).join(', ') + ' (or audio.define(name, voice))'); return; }\n7618-    if (this.ctx.state !== 'run