rld direction without converting it from screen space. Hovering the mouse never counted as using the mouse, because the engine only switches to the mouse on a click, so hover focus and mouse-button prompts didn't work until a click.\",","     \"4 were critical or game-breaking. The title crash broke attract mode. The fight waves never advancing blocked chapter 4. The missing booth step blocked the finale. The finale leaking into the Collection Run ended runs early.\",","     \"The headless Node test (test.mjs). It plays the whole story through game.debug: the paper, ducks, the car, therapy, breathing, the pork store, three collections, the alley fight, Ma, the yard waves, Ralphie, the diner, the cut to black, then the Collection Run. It caught every blocking bug in seconds.\",","     \"Setting the stress straight to 100 for a panic screenshot. That skips addStress(), so no panic attack ever started and the picture only showed the RAGE bar.\""]}]}],"moreFiles":6,"changedFiles":["/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181316__x96eb17/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181316__x96eb17/work/TheSopraniacs-TheSopranos-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181316.html","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181316__x96eb17/work/TheSopraniacs-TheSopranos-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181316/index.html","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181316__x96eb17/work/TheSopraniacs-TheSopranos-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181316/src/about.js","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181316__x96eb17/work/exit-interview.json","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181319__xb81546/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181328__x694301/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium__20261102-184349__x8b64cc/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-