{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgfAdyNq7B54XrrhQdiex","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Some of these I can show directly; one I can't. Real hardware isn't available here, and TASK.md says to write \"unknown\" for anything that can't be confirmed, which is how Usage is answered. Everything else I'll show as rendered evidence:\n- controller prompts drawn with an emulated pad, PlayStation and Xbox\n- the mouse hover focusing a hotspot\n- ghosts visible on screen in a live hub round\n- touch-only attract mode in Chromium as well as WebKit"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3014,"cache_read_input_tokens":358766,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3014,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b632459b-63ed-4a16-8c86-b1a0aae1dd98","uuid":"80c25cef-fa89-4c41-a3c4-fd1eaf05ea18","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:58:55.005Z","request_id":"req_011CgfAdxw49vz1sEKgCoaVb"}
