0b8f1413e9f\"}","+{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"Exit code 1\\nok\\ntest ok\\nok   the title waits for start\\nok   start opens the title menu item START SHIFT via confirm\\nok   confirm on START SHIFT begins play\\nok   the clock runs one game minute a second\\nok   the HUD knows the shift length\\nok   a piece of evidence can be picked up\\nok   tuning opens on the pole\\nok   three locks on the pole give a wire tap\\nok   a miss on the pole keeps the tune open\\nok   cancel stops the tune\\nFAIL walking away from Tonic leaves him to talk to later: Talk to Tonic\\nFAIL Delores gives a statement when promised protection: {\\\"scene\\\":\\\"play\\\",\\\"hero\\\":[264,184],\\\"heat\\\":0,\\\"banked\\\":0,\\\"carry\\\":[\\\"pager\\\",\\\"wire\\\"],\\\"elapsed\\\":10.4,\\\"outcome\\\":null,\\\"tune\\\":false,\\\"talking\\\":true}\\nFAIL flashing the badge at Tonic takes the ledger and burns once: {\\\"scene\\\":\\\"play\\\",\\\"hero\\\":[264,184],\\\"heat\\\":0,\\\"banked\\\":0,\\\"carry\\\":[\\\"pager\\\",\\\"wire\\\"],\\\"elapsed\\\":10.4,\\\"outcome\\\":null,\\\"tune\\\":false,\\\"talking\\\":true}\\nFAIL banking the carried pieces moves them to the case: {\\\"scene\\\":\\\"play\\\",\\\"hero\\\":[264,184],\\\"heat\\\":0,\\\"banked\\\":2,\\\"carry\\\":[],\\\"elapsed\\\":10.4,\\\"outcome\\\":null,\\\"tune\\\":false,\\\"talking\\\":true}\\nok   a burn adds one heat and quiets the corner\\nok   lookouts are hidden while the corner is quiet\\nFAIL the third burn ends the shift as burned: {\\\"scene\\\":\\\"play\\\",\\\"hero\\\":[264,184],\\\"heat\\\":2,\\\"banked\\\":2,\\\"carry\\\":[],\\\"elapsed\\\":10.4,\\\"outcome\\\":null,\\\"tune\\\":false,\\\"talking\\\":true}\\nFAIL a new shift starts fresh: {\\\"scene\\\":\\\"play\\\",\\\"hero\\\":[264,184],\\\"heat\\\":2,\\\"banked\\\":2,\\\"carry\\\":[],\\\"elapsed\\\":10.4,\\\"outcome\\\":null,\\\"tune\\\":false,\\\"talking\\\":true}\\nFAIL banking four pieces wins the case: {\\\"scene\\\":\\\"play\\\",\\\"hero\\\":[264,184],\\\"heat\\\":2,\\\"banked\\\":4,\\\"carry\\\":[],\\\"elapsed\\\":10.4,\\\"outcome\\\":\\\"case\\\",\\\"tune\\\":false,\\\"talking\\\":true}\\nok   the shift ends at 24:00\\nok   invert left-right flips the stick\\nok   invert up-down flips the stick\\nok   ten seconds without input starts the attract demo\\nok   the attract AI plays a shift to a case made\\nok   results in attract return to the demo\\nFAIL any input leaves the attract demo: {\\\"scene\\\":\\\"results\\\",\\\"hero\\\":[368,120],\\\"heat\\\":0,\\\"banked\\\":6,\\\"carry\\\":[],\\\"elapsed\\\":7,\\\"outcome\\\":\\\"case\\\",\\\"tune\\\":false,\\\"talking\\\":false}\\nok   no errors\\n8 check(s) failed, 19 passed\",\"is_error\":true,\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_013zZ61AsbwbtBMMQqU44qCb\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"4accd60f-1720-4154-a575-c0b8f1413e9f\",\"uuid\":\"a9c1c7ef-dbbc-4589-95b6-f63a8bee7304\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-03T02:05:33.091Z\",\"tool_use_result\":\"Error: Exit code 1\\nok\\ntest ok\\nok   the title waits for start\\nok   start opens the title menu item START SHIFT via confirm\\nok   confirm on START SHIFT begins play\\nok   the clock runs one game minute a second\\nok   the HUD knows the shift length\\nok   a piece of evidence can be picked up\\nok   tuning opens on the pole\\nok   three locks on the pole give a wire tap\\nok   a miss on the pole keeps the tune open\\nok   cancel stops the tune\\nFAIL walking away from Tonic leaves him to talk to later: Talk to Tonic\\nFAIL Delores gives a statement when promised protection: {\\\"scene\\\":\\\"play\\\",\\\"hero\\\":[264,184],\\\"heat\\\":0,\\\"banked\\\":0,\\\"carry\\\":[\\\"pager\\\",\\\"wire\\\"],\\\"elapsed\\\":10.4,\\\"outcome\\\":null,\\\"tune\\\":false,\\\"talking\\\":true}\\nFAIL flashing the badge at Tonic takes the ledger and burns once: {\\\"scene\\\":\\\"play\\\",\\\"hero\\\":[264,184],\\\"heat\\\":0,\\\"banked\\\":0,\\\"carry\\\":[\\\"pag